CONTENT: ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
============================

These files are content:

  - The Posts: the directory src/features/blog/posts/ and every file in it.
  - The images: every file in the repository whose name ends in .avif,
    .gif, .ico, .jpeg, .jpg, .png, .svg or .webp.

The CV text and the Project write-ups are content too, in whatever file
they are kept. Neither is in the repository yet. When they are added,
their paths will join the list above.

